WEBVTT

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:05.080
Ooh! (GRUNTS)

00:00:05.680 --> 00:00:06.680
(GROANS)

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.640
(BELLS RINGING)

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:11.240
(SQUEALS)

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:13.800
Got it! (CHUCKLES)

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:17.720
(WHOOPING)

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:21.640
-Fear Tech's mascot! MU rules!
-(ALL CHEERING)

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:23.720
(LAUGHS)

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:28.400
ALL: (CHANTING) M-U! M-U! M-U!

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:31.480
JTC PRESIDENT:
Did you see him catch that pig?

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:33.720
You are Jaws Theta Chi material,
freshman.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:34.920
Oh, thanks. I don't know...

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:37.120
No, no, no. He's an Omega Howl guy.

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:39.680
-Back off. We saw him first.
-No way. We did!

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:42.120
JOHNNY: I'll take it from here,
gentlemen.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.040
Johnny Worthington,
president of Roar Omega Roar.

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:47.840
What's your name, big blue?

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.840
Jimmy Sullivan. Friends call me Sulley.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:52.400
This guy's a Sullivan?
Like the famous Sullivan?

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.160
I can't believe it! That is crazy!
(LAUGHING)

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:55.800
-Chet, calm down.
-I'm sorry.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.760
Sulley, any freshman with the guts
to pull off a stunt like that

00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:01.240
has got "Future Scarer"
written all over him.

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.800
Hey, did you see me ride the pig?
That took guts.

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:07.160
Slow down, squirt.
This party is for Scare students only.

00:01:07.240 --> 00:01:09.840
Oh, sorry, killer,
but you might want to hang out

00:01:09.920 --> 00:01:11.640
with someone a little more your speed.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:13.480
Uh... They look fun!

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.160
Oh, hey there.
Want to join Oozma Kappa?

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:17.400
We have cake.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.240
Go crazy.

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.360
-Is that a joke?
-(JOHNNY GROANS)

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:27.160
Sulley, talk to your friend.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:29.360
Oh, he's not really my friend, but sure.

00:01:29.440 --> 00:01:31.760
You heard him.
This is a party for Scare students.

00:01:32.120 --> 00:01:33.440
I am a Scare student.

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:35.560
I mean for Scare students who actually,

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.680
you know, have a chance.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.400
-Aw, snap!
-(ALL LAUGHING)

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.240
My chances are just as good as yours.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.160
You're not even
in the same league with me.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:46.200
Just wait, hotshot.

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:48.560
I'm going to scare circles
around you this year.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:50.760
(CHUCKLING) Oh, okay.
I'd like to see that.

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:53.720
Oh, don't worry. You will.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.040
KNIGHT: Ready position.

00:02:01.280 --> 00:02:02.520
-Common crouch.
-(ALL GROWL)

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:06.720
I want to see matted fur
and yellow teeth. Basic snarl.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.880
-(ALL SNARL)
-Show me some slobber.

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:11.080
Drool is a tool, kids. Use it.

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.200
(ROARS SOFTLY)

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:15.040
Now here is a monster
who looks like a Scarer.

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:18.560
You want a hope of passing
this class, you better eat,

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.880
-breathe, and sleep Scaring.
-(CLICKS TONGUE)

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:23.520
(RATTLING)

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:26.160
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:32.000
(GASPS)

00:02:34.560 --> 00:02:35.800
(GROWLS)

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:45.360
(STUDENTS CHATTERING
INDISTINCTLY)

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:47.600
(ALL CHEERING)

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:48.960
Yeah!

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:50.200
MIKE: Give me another one.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:51.600
-Fear of spiders.
-Arachnophobia.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:52.960
-Fear of thunder.
-Keraunophobia.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.080
-Fear of chopsticks!
-Consecotaleophobia.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:56.800
What is this, kindergarten?
Give me a hard one.

00:02:57.000 --> 00:02:58.160
-(DRUM ROLL)
-(CROWD CHEERING)

00:02:58.240 --> 00:03:01.040
CHEERLEADERS: Go Monsters U!
You know what to do!

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:02.480
(PANTING)

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:03.680
(BOTH GRUNT)

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.040
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:07.760
(ALL CHEERING)

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.080
The answer is C, fangs.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.520
Well done, Mr. Wazowski.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:15.520
-A bowl of spiders!
-Correct!

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.720
-A clown running in the dark!
-Right again.

00:03:17.960 --> 00:03:19.840
Warts, boils, and moles, in that order.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:21.400
-KNIGHT: Outstanding!
-(SIGHS)

00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:36.440
-Ah! Whoa!
-(LAUGHING)

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.280
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:40.560
(YELPING)

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.040
(ROARING)

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.400
Ah!

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:05.480
(WHIMPERS)

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:07.760
(CONTINUES ROARING)

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:13.400
-Ogre slump.
-(ROARS SOFTLY)

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.800
-Zombie snarl.
-(SNARLS)

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.040
-Dominant silverback gorilla.
-(GROWLS)

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.960
That is some remarkable
improvement, Michael.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.560
(ROARS SOFTLY)

00:04:21.840 --> 00:04:25.320
One frightening face does not
a Scarer make, Mr. Sullivan.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:27.120
(CLICKS TONGUE)

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.480
(MUTTERING)

00:04:39.520 --> 00:04:41.280
A Tauntaun Grimace with Extra Slobber.

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.280
-You got it!
-That's what I'm saying.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:46.200
I am going to wipe the floor
with that little know-it-all.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.800
Yes, you are, big blue.

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.840
Hey, wait. What are you guys...

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:51.600
It's just a precaution.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.920
RORs are the best Scarers
on campus, Sullivan.

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.960
Can't have a member getting
shown up by a beach ball.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:57.520
Whoo-hoo! I am on a roll.

00:04:57.840 --> 00:04:59.160
I'm going to destroy that guy.

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:01.560
Well, then you'll get this back
right away.

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:04.960
It's time to start delivering
on that Sullivan name.

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:11.400
Today's final will judge your ability
to assess a child's fear

00:05:11.520 --> 00:05:15.640
and perform the appropriate Scare
in the Scare Simulator.

00:05:15.720 --> 00:05:16.760
(DOOR CREAKING)

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:19.160
(THUD)

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:21.200
(STUDENTS MURMURING)

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:23.880
The Child Sensitivity Level will be raised

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.880
from Bed-wetter to Heavy Sleeper,

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.560
so give it everything you've got.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.920
Dean Hardscrabble is with us
this morning

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:34.280
to see who will be moving on
in the Scaring program

00:05:34.880 --> 00:05:36.160
and who will not.

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:43.000
Let's get started.

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:47.920
I am a five-year-old girl
afraid of spiders and Santa Claus.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.040
Which Scare do you use?

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:52.000
Uh...

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:57.800
That's a Seasonal Creep and Crawl.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.200
Demonstrate.

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.440
-(ROARS)
-(SCREAMS)

00:06:06.280 --> 00:06:07.360
(BELL DINGS)

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:10.680
Results will be posted
outside my office. Next.

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.960
Focus. (EXHALES)

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:16.120
Johnson, Crackle and Howl.
Yes! (CHUCKLES)

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:18.560
(DOOR OPENS)

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:26.560
-(MONSTER ROARS)
-(DUMMY KID SCREAMS)

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:32.400
Hey. Do you mind?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.120
Don't mind at all.

00:06:35.600 --> 00:06:36.760
(ROARS SOFTLY)

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.480
Come on, Mike. Let's just move.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:44.520
Stay out of my way.

00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:47.920
Unlike you, I had to work hard
to get into the Scare program.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:49.400
(SCOFFS)

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:51.440
That's because you don't belong here.

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.120
(ROARS)

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.000
(ROARS LOUDLY)

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.320
(LAUGHS) That's what I thought.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:05.600
(ROARING SOFTLY)

00:07:07.240 --> 00:07:08.440
(ROARING)

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.480
-(WHISPERING)
-(GASPS)

00:07:15.320 --> 00:07:16.680
(BOTH ROARING)

00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:20.720
Whoa! Whoa...

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.120
-(CLANKS)
-(ALL GASP)

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.280
(CLATTERING)

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:28.720
(ALL GASPING)

00:07:30.520 --> 00:07:31.640
(SCREAMS ESCAPING)

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.200
(ALL GASPING)

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.360
(ALL SIGHING IN RELIEF)

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:49.840
(BOTH GASP)

